12 |text from stevew helios unl edu steve subject crypto final call organization university nebraska lincoln lines 258 nntp posting host helios unl edu crypto conference announcement final call for papers the thirteenth annual crypto conference sponsored the international association for cryptologic research iacr cooperation with the ieee computer society technical committee security and privacy the computer science department the university california santa barbara and bell northern research subsidiary northern telecom will held the campus the university california santa barbara august 1993 original research papers and technical expository talks are solicited all practical and theoretical aspects cryptology anticipated that some talks may also presented special invitation the program committee instructions for authors authors are requested send copies detailed abstract not full paper april 1993 the program chair the address given below limit pages 12pt type not counting the bibliography the title page placed all submissions submissions must arrive time postmarked later than april 1993 and sent airmail order receive consideration the program committee required that submissions start with succinct statement the problem addressed the solution proposed and its significance cryptology appropriate for non specialist reader technical development directed the specialist should follow needed abstracts that have been submitted other conferences that have proceedings are not eligible for submission submissions must anonymous this means that names and affiliations authors should only appear the title page the submission should possible remove this page and send the papers program committee members latex style file that produces output this format available email from the program chair authors will informed acceptance rejection letter mailed before june 1993 compilation all accepted abstracts will available the conference the form pre proceedings authors accepted abstracts will allowed submit revised versions for the pre proceedings revised abstract should contain only minor changes and corrections the originally submitted abstract all revised abstracts must received the program chair july 1993 the page limit will strictly enforced for the pre proceedings complete conference proceedings are expected published springer verlag lecture notes computer science series later date pending negotiation the program committee consists stinson chair nebraska bellare ibm watson biham technion israel brickell sandia national labs feigenbaum bell labs impagliazzo ucsd odlyzko bell labs okamoto ntt japan pfitzmann hildesheim germany rueppel switzerland vanstone waterloo canada send submissions the program chair douglas stinson crypto computer science and engineering department 115 ferguson hall university nebraska lincoln 68588 0115 usa telephone 402 472 7791 fax 402 472 7767 internet stinson bibd unl edu for other information contact the general chair paul van oorschot crypto bell northern research mail stop 000 3500 carling ave nepean ontario k2h 8e9 canada telephone 613 763 4199 fax 613 763 2626 internet crypto93 bnr crypto general information august 1993 the program crypto the thirteenth series workshops cryptology held santa barbara and sponsored the international association for cryptologic research cooperation with the ieee computer society technical committee security and privacy the computer science department the university california santa barbara and bell northern research subsidiary northern telecom the program for the workshop will cover all aspects cryptology extended abstracts the papers presented the conference will distributed all attendees the conference and formal proceedings will published later date addition the regular program papers selected invited the program committee there will rump session tuesday evening for informal presentations facilities will also provided for attendees demonstrate hardware software and other items cryptographic interest you wish demonstrate such items you are urged contact the general chair that your needs will attended the social program will include hosted cocktail parties sunday and monday addition there will beach barbecue wednesday evening the price the barbecue included the room and board charge and extra tickets may purchased about the conference facilities the workshop will held the campus the university california santa barbara the campus located adjacent the santa barbara airport and the pacific ocean accommodations are available the university dormitories relatively low cost for conference participants children under the age are not allowed stay the dormitories those bringing small children will need make separate arrangements one several nearby hotels more information hotels enclosed parking campus available cost the participants however participants must indicate the registration form they desire parking permit travel information the campus located approximately miles from the santa barbara airport which served several airlines including american america west delta united and air free shuttle bus service will provided between the santa barbara airport and the campus sunday and thursday afternoons all major rental car agencies are also represented santa barbara and amtrak has rail connections san francisco from the north and los angeles from the south santa barbara approximately 100 miles north los angeles airport and 350 miles south san francisco registration participation invited interested parties but attendance the workshop limited and pre registration strongly advised late registrations subject late registration fee may accepted space available but there are guarantees register fill out the attached registration form and return the address the form along with payment full before july 1993 campus accommodations will available first come first serve basis for attendees who register july 1993 the conference fees include participation the program and all social functions well membership the iacr and subscription the journal cryptology the room and board charges include dormitory lodging and meals from dinner sunday lunch thursday technical sessions will run from monday morning thursday noon very limited number stipends are available those unable obtain funding applications for stipends should sent the general chair before june 1993 crypto crypto registration form registration deadline july 1993 last name _____________________________________________ first name _____________________________________________ sex affiliation _______________________________________________________________ mailing address __________________________________________________________ __________________________________________________________ __________________________________________________________ ___________________________________________________________ phone __________________________________ fax ___________________________ electronic mail __________________________________________________________ payment the conference fee entitles you membership the international association for cryptologic research for one year extra charge including subscription the journal cryptology published springer verlag extra charge you wish iacr member yes__ no__ the conference fee also includes the conference proceedings when they become available containing final versions conference papers the book extended abstracts distributed the conference will contain only shortened preliminary versions these papers maximum pages conference fee regular 280 _______ attended eurocrypt norway 230 _______ full time student 190 _______ deduct you not wish proceedings _______ total conference fee _______ room and board nights smoking ___ non smoking ___ single room 275 per person _______ double room 225 per person _______ roommate name ____________________________________ extra barbecue tickets each one included room and board _______ late fee for registration after july