lim community discuss the doctrines origin and teachings this puissant spiritual force earth iii examine islamic teachings and beliefs general light the quran and established islamic traditions centuries from ahmadiyya perspective discuss the similarities between ahmadi muslims and people other religions the world and discuss how religious tolerance and respect other faiths can brought about eliminate inter religion rivalries and hatred among people religions discuss the origin and teachings all religions general and islamic and ahmadiyya muslims particular foster better understanding among ahmadi muslims and other religious people discuss current world problems and solution these problems offered religion vii exchange important news and views about the ahmadiyya muslim community and other religions viii add diversity the religious newsgroups present usenet discuss why religious persecution the rise the world and find solutions remedy the ever deter iorating situation the world general and the islamic world particular discuss the contributions founders all reli gions and their people for humanity society and world peace general and the international ahmadiyya mus lim community particular type the group will moderated for orderly and free religious dialo gue the moderation will not prevent disagreement dissent beliefs but will mainly used prevent derogatory squalid use dialect and irrelevant issues the moderators have been decided through personal mail and through general consensus among the proponants discussion news groups the following moderators have been proposed and agreed upon moderator nabeel rana rana rintintin colorado edu moderator tahir ijaz ijaz ccu umanitoba brief description about ahmadiyya islam the ahmadiyya movement islam international organi sation was founder 1989 qadian india the founder this sect hazrat mirza ghulam ahmad 1835 1908 proclaimed the promised reformer this age foretold almost all the major religions the world today islam christianity judiasm hin duism claimed the long awaited second comming jesus christ metaphorically the muslim mahdi and the promised messiah claimed that the prophecies contained almost all the great religions the world about the advent messenger from god have been fulfilled the claims hazrat ahmad raised storms hostility and extreme oposition from many priestlike people muslims chris tians jews and hindus that age such opposition often wit nessed the history divine reformers even today this sect being persecuted specially some the muslim regimes dispite the opposition and persecution this sect has won many adherents 130 countries has over million followers who come from diverse ethnic and cultural background the sect devoted world peace and bringing about better understanding religion and the founders all reli gions its mission unite mankind into one universal broth erhood and develop better understanding faith ahmadi muslims have always been opposed all kind violence and spe cially religious intollerance and fundamentalism among its many philanthropic activities the sect has tablished network hundreds schools hospitals and clin ics many third world countries these institutions are staffed volunteer professional and are fully financed the sect internal resources the ahmadiyya mission bring about universal moral reform establish peace and justice and unite mankind under one universal religion newsgroup creation when the call for votes called the discussion will officially end voting will held for about three weeks the group gets 3rd majority and 100 more yes create votes than don create votes the group shall created any questions comments may included the discussion directly sent rana rintintin colorado edu
