1 |text from mathew mathew mantis subject alt atheism faq introduction atheism summary please read this file before posting alt atheism keywords faq atheism expires thu may 1993 gmt distribution world organization mantis consultants cambridge supersedes 19930308134439 mantis lines 646 archive name atheism introduction alt atheism archive name introduction last modified april 1993 version begin pgp signed message introduction atheism mathew mathew mantis this article attempts provide general introduction atheism whilst have tried neutral possible regarding contentious issues you should always remember that this document represents only one viewpoint would encourage you read widely and draw your own conclusions some relevant books are listed companion article provide sense cohesion and progression have presented this article imaginary conversation between atheist and theist all the questions asked the imaginary theist are questions which have been cropped repeatedly alt atheism since the newsgroup was created some other frequently asked questions are answered companion article please note that this article arguably slanted towards answering questions posed from christian viewpoint this because the faq files reflect questions which have actually been asked and predominantly christians who proselytize alt atheism when talk religion talking primarily about religions such christianity judaism and islam which involve some sort superhuman divine being much the discussion will apply other religions but some may not what atheism atheism characterized absence belief the existence god some atheists further and believe that god does not exist the former often referred the weak atheist position and the latter strong atheism important note the difference between these two positions weak atheism simple scepticism disbelief the existence god strong atheism positive belief that god does not exist please not fall into the trap assuming that all atheists are strong atheists some atheis