g with the key shared both encryptor and decryptor the value bit variable used some modes the value bit variable used some modes lsb the least significant right most bits msb the most significant left most bits operators defined the langage electronic code book ecb and are each bits long encryption decryption cipher block chaining cbc and are each bits long encryption decryption bit cipher feedback cfb and are each bits long encryption decryption all msb msb all note that for this reduces all all cfb notes since depends only the plain cipher text from the previous operation the function can performed parallel with the reception the text with which used bit output feedback ofb and are each bits long encryption decryption all msb msb all note that for this reduces all all ofb notes encryption and decryption are identical since independent and the function can performed advance the receipt the plain cipher text with which used additional notes des modes operation ecb and cbc use encrypt and decrypt but the feedback modes use both encrypt and decrypt this disproves the erroneous claim that systems which feature but not cannot used for data confidentiality and therefore are not subject export controls
