 cated cating cates render obscure darken confuse their emotions obfuscated their judgment llat obfuscare darken intensive lat fuscare darken fuscus dark obfuscation obfuscatory adj goals the contest write the most obscure obfuscated program under the rules below show the importance programming style ironic way stress compilers with unusual code illustrate some the subtleties the language provide safe forum for poor code the ioccc the grandfather usenet programming contests since 1984 this contest demonstrated that program that simply works correctly not sufficient the ioccc has also done much add the arcane word obfuscated back into the english language see the new hacker dictionary eric raymond you are strongly encouraged read the new contest rules before sending any entries the rules and sometimes the contest email address itself change over time valid entry one year may rejected later year due changes the rules the typical start date for contests early march contest rules are normally not finalized and posted until the beginning the contest the typical closing date for contests are early may the rules and the guidelines may and often change from year year you should sure you have the current rules and guidelines prior submitting entries obtain them send email the address above and use the subject send rules one may obtain winners previous contests 1984 date via ftp from host ftp net 192 user anonymous pass yourname yourhost dir pub ioccc last resort previous winners may obtained sending email the above address please use the subject send year winners where year single digit year year range all 0th international obfuscated perl contest landon noll larry wall this content being planned someday when landon larry are not too busy they will actually get around posting the first set rules landon says yes know that said would have contest 1993 but other existing projects got the way hopefully something will developed after nov 1993 2nd international obfuscated postscript contest jonathan monsarrat jgm brown edu alena lacova alena nikhef contest programming skills and knowledge exclusively for the postscript programming language its purpose spread knowledge postscript and its details applaud those with the best tricks prove that humans can beat those damnable machine generators their own game writing the most obscure and mysterious postscript programs ever winners will receive the fame and attention that goes with having their program entry posted winner programmers world wide the 1993 contest rules and results are available ftp wilma brown edu pub postscript obfuscated shar individually the obfuscated directory the judges will post the 1994 rules november comp lang postscript usenet and other places send questions jgm brown edu categories include best obfuscated postscript best artwork most compact best interactive program most useful and anything unusual and creative that deserves award the judges will choose the winners each category alena lacova system administrator nikhef institute for high energy and nuclear physics the netherlands she the author the postscript chaos programs which draw julia sets mandelbrot sets and other kinds fractal functions jonathan monsarrat graduate student from mit and brown university the the faq maintainer for the usenet newsgroup comp lang postscript and the author the postscript zone and lametex shar_eof chmod 0444 obfuscate info echo restore obfuscate info failed set obfuscate info wc_c test wc_c 6418 then echo original size 6418 current size wc_c exit sunnyvale residents vote landon noll for sunnyvale city council seat
