5 |text from guykuo carson washington edu guy kuo subject quadra 700 memory install faq organization university washington lines nntp posting host carson washington edu summary instructions for quadra 700 memory installation keywords memory quadra 700 install this turning into faq here how violate your quadra 700 warranty and install your own memory insert usual disclaimer here remove the top lid the machine you will see the floppy disk and hard drive mounted plastic tower follow the usual anti static precautions and course make sure the machine off when you this unplug the wall and monitor power supply cords from the back the mac remove the power supply pulling the plastic interlocking tab the tower forward and simultaneously pulling the power supply straight the tab piece plastic from the left posterior aspect the tower which extends downward hook the power supply you may also feel horseshoe shaped piece the right portion the power supply leave that alone the plastic tab from the tower all you need release look the rear the tower assembly you will see the flat ribbon scsi connector the hard drive power cable and flat ribbon cable leading the floppy drive disconnect all these from the motherboard the hard drive power cable connector has tab which must squeezed release unplug the drive activity led from its clear plastic mount look down the posterior cylindrical section the plastic tower phillips head screw the base remove taking care not drop into the case bit gummy glue your screwdriver helpful here remove the tower assembly pulling medially the plastic tab the right side the tower this tab prevents the tower from sliding posteriorly slide the entire tower assembly posteriorly then lift the tower assembly straight and out the case congratulations you have now gained access your machine simm slots the six big slots are for vram one usually must install all six gain useful video modes all simms ram vram installed with their chips facing the front the motherboard the four smaller sockets front are for ram simms install simms sets four into these sockets sure you seat the simms squarely and firmly into fully upright position reinstall the tower assembly first placing the right wall the tower against the right wall the case with the tower assembly about posterior its intended position lower the tower assembly into place while maintaining contact with the right wall the case once fully down slide the tower assembly anteriorly until clicks into place reconnect the motherboard ends the cables dont forget the floppy drive cable replace the phillips head screw drop the power supply straight down into place until clicks plug the hard drive activity light back into its clear plastic mount guy kuo guykuo washington edu
