n the public will only have confidence the security standard that open independent expert scrutiny third while the use the use split key dual escrowed system may prove reasonable balance between privacy and law enforcement needs the details this scheme must explored publicly before adopted what will give people confidence the safety their keys does disclosure keys third party waive individual fifth amendment rights subsequent criminal inquiries these are but few the many questions the administrations proposal raised but fails answer sum the administration has shown great sensitivity the importance these issues planning comprehensive inquiry into digital privacy and security however the clipper chip solution ought considered part the inquiry and not adopted before the discussion even begins details the proposal escrow the bit key will divided between two escrow agents each whom hold bits each key the manufacturer the communications device would required register all keys with the two independent escrow agents key tied the device however not the person using upon presentation valid court order the two escrow agents would have turn the key parts over law enforcement agents according the presidential directive just issued the attorney general will asked identify appropriate escrow agents some the administration have suggested that one non law enforcement federal agency perhaps the federal reserve and one non governmental organization could chosen but there agreement the identity the agents yet classified algorithm and the possibility back doors the administration claims that there are back doors means which the government others could break the code without securing keys from the escrow agents and that the president will told there are back doors this classified algorithm order prove this administration sources are interested arranging for all star crypto cracker team come under security arrangement and examine the algorithm for trap doors the results the investigation 