on americans looking for full time work simply can let the bill languish when know that even compromise bill will mean hundreds thousands jobs for our people the mandate act achieve change and move the country forward taking this initiative the face unrelenting senate talkathon think can respond your mandate and achieve significant portion our original goals first want keep the programs much possible that are needed generate jobs and meet human needs including highway and road construction summer jobs for young people immunization for children construction waste water sites and aid small businesses also want keep funding for extended unemployment compensation benefits for people who have been unemployed for long time because the economy isn creating jobs second recommended that all the other programs the bill cut across the board little more than percent and third recommended new element this program help immediately start our attempt fight against crime providing 200 million for cities and towns rehire police officers who lost their jobs during the recession and put them back work protecting our people also going fight for tough crime bill because the people this country need and deserve now the people who are filibustering this bill the republican senators say they won vote for because increases deficit spending because there extra spending this year that hasn already been approved that sounds reasonable doesn here what they don say this program more than paid for budget cuts over five year budget and this budget well within the spending limits already approved the congress this year amazing that many these same senators who are filibustering the bill voted during the previous administration for billions dollars the same kind emergency spending and much was not designed put the american people work this not about deficit spending have offered plan cut the deficit this about where your priorities are people politics keep mind that our jobs bill paid for dollar for 