ar this compares 810 000 the they can sell their time for about million compared million the rimsat will launch their satellites protons get the best prices they bought bulk they have the rights twelve launches any you need lift can give you their address the first launch scheduled for october and they are getting one used satellite from the russians which being moved into place now tidbits sternberg says this kind thing has done entrepreneurs not big business because big business just like what they have over there except that have better paper both the bathroom and the copier russian launches are self insured the promise replace failed launch within months major investors rimsat include russell which huge retirement fund organization cellsat which big telecom business southeast asia and fund operated some the big names aerospace which says sort insurance policy for them this really takes off downplayed the instabilites the ussr saying that are worried partly because aren used seeing russia anything but unvarying monolith italy gets new government every two weeks but don worry because used predicted that once get used seeing what really goes russia won worry about their stability much part the problem with cooperative ventures the problem transfering money the central bank has policy taking hard currency payments putting their coffers and replacing the rest with the equivalent value rubles get around this rimsat pays their hard currency into austrian bank account npo then pays their contractors with foreign currency that the only the contractors get swindled the government one the big problems rimsat has had stonewalling the western satellite industry however intelsat recently bought three the same type satellites which was rather reassuring the biggest worry most people have about russian satellites the primitive technology and shorter lifetime the older gorizont horizon satellites have lifetime about years while the more modern express satellites compare well with western technology and last about years while this much shorter than years for western satellites sternberg downplayed the difference these prices they can afford launch new ones addition shorter lifetimes mean that they can replace their equipment with newer technology they will able compete better than older out date hardware josh hopkins jbh55289 uxa cso uiuc edu find way make one attributed hannibal
