s actually you count the credit card key that came the owner binder got keys but since the credit card key doesn have any teeth cut yet guess won count rear hatch has padding corners when waiting for the day when bash head the corner horn buttons behind air bag spokes and not center personal preference the latter probably because the air bag pretty much takes all the space where you expect find the horn speaking the horn was surprised find that the probe comes with one those nice merican sounding horns instead the japanese sounding kind the previous probes had japanese horns tires fling dirt mud onto side car yeah not very badly but enough annoying sometimes likes engine design valves sounds smoothness power mileage torque definitely handling very good for fwd understeer only limits transmission the speed must usable instrumentation lovely readable analog everywhere very little torque steer full power much better than the sho drive stability 100 mph high gearing though low cowl good visibility front heated outside mirrors nice fog never tested freezing weather abs air bag see above rear seats fold down have few rear seat passengers trunk not important shake rattle noises when going over bumps potholes still tires 225 55vr16 goodyear eagles left hoping for 30k agree strongly with all the above especially about the engine the interior very very nice too very pleasing the eye and ergonomically sound drive and from work each day relatively smooth roads and most noticable thing that the probe suspension doesn like potholes when you test drive one find potholed road somewhere around town and see the jarring you get tolerable yes this car stiff suspension isn for everyone personally like but you find little harsh but otherwise like the car strongly suggest looking into the you have passengers all means bring them along too they find that they have room the back and you find that the car rides differently that better you the problem with the back seat that there leg room plenty head room though shorter people fit back there without any complaints long the seat they are sitting behind pulled forward bit give them place put their feet also there lot glass around you which wasn expecting the temperature inside the car gets pretty hot the summer back seat passengers now very few complain about the lack ventilation you may want consider that when combined with the heat the power moonroof can greatly improve the ventilation throughout the car really enjoy the moonroof the way but then always been sucker for open air driving leakage problems anything like that yet heard that the exhaust system has trouble but mine works fine haven heard about this one know that some the very early probes and maybe had problems with prematurely rusting mufflers which ford will replace charge but haven heard about anything like this concerning the probes haven had any real trouble with this car outside joint boot that was leaking but the dealer took care that promptly and even gave free rental car for the day and half that was without car was quite happy with the way they handled especially considering that was expecting the worst from them from what heard sounds like ford mazda had some problems with the probe and probably when they first went into production but think these problems have mostly been corrected this point that almost always expected with completely new car like this though hope this helps chuck chuck kesler internet chuck eos ncsu edu unix systems programmer mail box 7901 ncsu campus engineering computer operations raleigh 27695 usa north carolina state university phone 919 515 2458
