 confidence the security standard that open independent expert scrutiny third while the use the split key dual escrowed system may prove reasonable balance between privacy and law enforcement needs the details this scheme must explored publicly before adopted what will give people confidence the safety their keys does disclosure keys third party waive individual fifth amendment rights subsequent criminal inquiries sum the administration has shown great sensitivity the importance these issues planning comprehensive inquiry into digital privacy and security however the clipper chip solution ought considered part the inquiry not adopted before the discussion even begins details the proposal escrow the bit key will divided between two escrow agents each whom hold bits each key upon presentation valid warrant the two escrow agents would have turn the key parts over law enforcement agents most likely the attorney general will asked identify appropriate escrow agents some the administration have suggested one non law enforcement federal agency perhaps the federal reserve and one non governmental organization but there agreement the identity the agents yet key registration would done the manufacturer the communications device key tied the device not the person using classified algorithm and the possibility back doors the administration claims that there are back door means which the government others could break the code without securing keys from the escrow agents and that the president will told there are back doors this classified algorithm order prove this administration sources are interested arranging for all star crypto cracker team come under security arrangement and examine the algorithm for trap doors the results the investigation would then made public government market driver order get market moving and show that the government believes the security this system the feds will the first big customers for this product users will include the fbi secret service gore 