15 |text from msjohnso donald wichitaks ncr com mark johnson subject big amateur rockets organization ncr corporation wichita lines pbd runyon cim cdc com paul dokas writes was reading popular science this morning and was surprised the back know that lot the ads the back are fringe science questionablely legal but this one really grabbed attention was from company name personal missle inc something like that the company was probably public missiles inc michigan anyhow the stated that they sell rockets that were length and engines sizes they also said that some rockets will reach 000 feet yup now aside from the obvious dangers any amateur rocketeer using one these beasts isn this illegal can imagine the faa allowing people shoot rockets through the flight levels passenger planes not even mention the problem locating rocket when comes down nope not illegal however closely regulated order purchase and use the big rocket motors required necessary one the following employee government agency employee student university doing research involving rockets member representative educational organization involved research other uses rockets there are two such organizations the tripoli rocketry association and the national association rocketry members either organization must demonstrate proficiency construction and flight before they are allowed purchase large motors their own the faa will issue waiver its regulations upon request any organization which can persuade them has taken adequate precautions avoid conflicts with aircraft the usual stipulations are only operation specified ceiling allowed depending the location this ceiling may from 5000 50000 feet agl the operator the rocket responsible for avoiding any aircraft within the operating radius around the launch site flight into clouds beyond visual range haze expressly prohibited the faa will provide notam informing other users the airspace that unmanned rocket operations are taking place the specified place and time most the launches that are held and there are dozens them every year are held areas where air traffic relatively light such over the western deserts the black rock desert north reno particularly popular since 150 miles nothing hit the ground the two rocketry associations test and approve motors for their members use insure safety depending motor size the launcher setback from 500 more feet the way rockets under and powered motor are exempt from most federal regulations unmanned rockets anyway see far 101 subpart for details for recovery although the higher altitude rockets can reach 000 feet most them only get 000 000 feet the typical rocket inches diameter and carries foot parachute multiple parachutes depending the payload many rockets also carry either small transmitter audio sounder particularly launches the eastern where there are more obstructions camera telemetry transmitter and video payloads are becoming quite common and not going even think buying one not that crazy why not lot fun check out the traffic rec models rockets for information about the model and under and high power everything bigger rocket hobbies with all dangerous activities the key practice safety been flying consumer rockets ranging lbs takeoff weight for years and still have all extremities intact paul mine 000 feet and carries pounds dynamite dokas that another thing explosive warheads any kind are allowed these rockets none please forgive for shouting but that one the biggest misconceptions people have about our hobby just remember you will die someday true but will not related the rocket hobby unless get hit while crossing road with rocket hand mark johnson usnail ncr peripheral products division mail mark johnson wichitaks ncr com 3718 rock voice 316 636 8189 654 8189 wichita 67226 non business email 76670 1775 compuserve com
