5 |text from altheimm nextnet csus edu murray altheim subject fix trackball organization california state university sacramento lines article 93105 152944br4416a auvm american edu br4416a auvm american edu writes the trackbal pb140 longer moves the horizontal direction when called the nearest authorized apple service person was told that probably needed replacing and that would cost over 150 ouch can anyone recommend less expensive way fix this problem one strange symptom the problem that when take the ball out the socket and shine light into the hole can make the cursor move horizontally moving the wheel with finger works fine that way but won work turn off the light any suggestions comments ben roy just poor college student internet br4416a american edu ben since you obviously adept enough understand how the trackball works the only thing short repairing that can think thorough cleaning all the parts and then checking for the proper placement the little blue rollers since they aren fixed position their stainless steel pins you might try sliding them into slightly different position powerbook 100 can slide them almost completely out contact with the trackball fact one the notes from sumex fixing the trackball advocates sliding the roller that its _edge_ contacts the ball not the center cylindrical area done this with pb100 and does seem improve the feel but needs adjusted from time time just popped open one our office pb170s and while there isn much latitude for movement one could still adjust the roller slightly your pb140 the same might help would suspect the most likely culprit slippery blue roller you can take out clean with mild soapy solution isopropyl alcohol also sure the ball grease free you drop the ball minus the retaining ring roll the ball and see actually causing the axle spin all this still doesn solve then maybe new one order could electrical connection which case replacement would necessary but experience with both mice and trackballs has been that dirt has been the normal problem not electrical malfunction hope this helps murray murray altheim ils ont orteil bouc chevreil oreille instructional consultant corne chamois face vermeille csu sacramento comme rouge croissant dancent toute nuict altheimm csus edu dedans carrefour pres une eau qui bruict
