his are the most annoying traffic sci crypt you have come with encryption scheme providing some ciphertext from not adequate nobody has ever been impressed random gibberish any new algorithm should secure even the opponent knows the full algorithm including how any message key distributed and only the private key kept secret there are some systematic and unsystematic ways take reasonably long ciphertexts and decrypt them even without prior knowledge the algorithm but this time consuming and possibly fruitless exercise which most sci crypt readers won bother with what you you have new encryption scheme first all find out really new look through this faq for references and related methods familiarize yourself with the literature and the introductory textbooks when you can appreciate how your cryptosystem fits into the world large try break yourself you shouldn waste the time tens thousands readers asking question which you could have easily answered your own you really think your system secure and you want get some reassurance from experts you might try posting full details your system including working code and solid theoretical explanation sci crypt keep mind that the export cryptography regulated some areas you lucky expert might take some interest what you posted you can encourage this offering cash rewards for instance noted cryptographer ralph merkle offering 1000 anyone who can break snefru but there are guarantees you don have enough experience then most likely any experts who look your system will able find flaw this happens your responsibility consider the flaw and learn from rather than just add one more layer complication and come back for another round different way get your cryptosystem reviewed have the nsa look full discussion this procedure outside the scope this faq among professionals common rule thumb that you want design cryptosystem you have have experience cryptanalyst
