16 |text from simon giaeb monash edu subject maria goretti organization monash university melb australia lines 125 heres the life maria goretti posted with kind permission the editor the australian catholic magazine morning star hope you like put with anything prevent sin maria goretti maria was born october 16th 1890 luigi and assunta goretti the eldest daughter the family seven she was cheerful girl always imitating her parents she had but one disire but one wish receive our lord the blessed sacrament the date was finally set for little maria receive our lord the feast corpus christi for maria time seemed like eter nity she slowly neared the great day when finally arrived jerome the priest who was celebrate the mass and give the children their first holy communion delivered sermon the immense love jesus christ for them and the great love should have return for him then warmly urged them die rather than commit mortal sin maria humbly approached the altar god and received the holy eucharist her only sadness was the thought her father absence who died some time beforehand for the rest the day maria remained under the spell the divine visit that until her thoughts changed when she could next holy communion thus ended the happiest day maria life over the next twelve months maria had changed from giggling little girl into quiet young lady with responsibilities her mother went out into the fields place her husband maria took the ironing cooking washing and other motherly duties she was doing this not only for her own family but also for the serenellis father and son who lived with the goretti owning share the farm although maria was poorer than all the other children she far surpassed them virtue all thi ngs she did the holy will god during the month june alessandro serenelli the son twice made advances upon maria when chanced alone with her both occasions maria managed struggle free alessandro strong grip but the second threatened kill her she even uttered word her mother from this day maria lived terror fearing lest alessandro attack again july 5th 1902 alessandro left work the fields get handkerchief claimed went the storeroom beneath the house where maria who was outside the landing with the baby could hear him fumbling about with tools she wondered what was doing was later learned that was sharpening blade went the house and called for maria she told him she wouldn him unless she knew why she was needed stormed out the landing and dragged her her room mar instantly realized what was not touch sin you will hell this point alessandro held the knife over maria chest who was now the floor will you will you not maria gathered all her energy will not alessandro she had chosen her martyrdom over sin god over satan overcome with rage alessandro plunged the knife into maria breast fourteen times finally came his senses and thought maria was dead frantically threw the knife behind closet and locked himself his room the crying the baby teresa the landing brought the attention assunta and the father alessandro the baby was unattended and was danger falling off they ran the house find maria who covered blood was dragging herself the door when asked what happened she said alessandro stabbed her wanted make wrong and would not the ambulance arrived then the police who took alessandro away the ambulance carried maria the hospital large crowd followed foot the doctors the hospital held hope for poor little maria the same jerome who gave maria her first communion came administer the last rites and give her holy viaticum asked maria she would forgive her murderer yes for the love jesus forgive him wish for him one day join paradise may god forgive him for alread have maria died about three clock alessandro was tried and found guilty maria death but because his age was sentenced only thirty years prison after eight years being violent prisoner and show ing regret for his crime saw dream the midst field flowers maria holding out bunch white lilies him soon later wrote the local bishop begging god par don for the grave sin had committed later gave testimony maria beatification 1947 less than three years later 24th 1950 maria was canonised assunta goretti was the first mother ever present her daughter canonisation may maria goretti help pure and grant the strength die rather than commit mortal sin saint maria goretti pray for brendan arthur internet simon giaeb monash edu viva cristo rey long live christ the king
