14 |text from robin ntmtv com robin coutellier subject critique pressure point massager originator robin volans nntp posting host volans reply robin ntmtv com robin coutellier organization northern telecom inc mountain view distribution lines 141 promised below personal critique pressure point massager recently bought from the self care catalog very pleased with the results the catalog description follows the pressure point massager aggressive physical massager that actually kneads the tension out muscles much like professional shiatsu masseur the powerful motor drives two counter rotating thumbs that move one inch orbits releasing tension the neck back legs and arms pressure point massager a2623 109 order receive catalog call hours days 800 345 3371 fax 800 345 4021 note when ordered the massager the item number was different and the price was 179 not 109 when received glanced thru the newer catalog enclosed with see anything was different from the first one was quite annoyed see difference price called them about and the cust rep said that they had switched manufacturers although looks and works exactly the same told ahead and return the first one and order the cheaper one using the price difference reason for return fact since the newer ones might take while ship from the factory received this one days told could use the one already have until the new one arrives then return the old one very reasonable people have long term neck shoulder and back pain were building would described structurally unsound have stretches and exercises that help but the problem never really goes away for whatever reason not exercise for while illness not enough time lazy etc the muscles become quite stiff and painful and thus more prone further strain even with exercise sometimes require physical therapy get back track which 1st requires doctor visit get the prescription for the tension neck not released eventually causes headache sometimes confused with sinus headache over left eye when physical therapist has massaged neck and the sub occipital muscles particular the knobby areas near the base the skull the headache usually eased within day although hurts like hell while being massaged ordered this device because seemed exactly what was wishing someone would invent machine that would massage not vibrate neck and sub occipital muscles like physical therapist has done the past that could use myself doctor visit inconvenient appts for week later would needed use could get the middle the night and use necessary have been using for about week now and love the base unit about rectangle about high with handles each side and plugs into average outlet the two metal thumbs are about diameter and protrude about above the base the thumbs are covered with gray cloth that non removable they are located more toward one end rather than centered see figure below they move either clockwise counter clockwise directions depending which side the switch pushed and are very quiet can used from either side for instance the thumbs can positioned the base the neck the top the neck depending which direction you approach _______________________________ _______________ _______________ _______________________________ for the neck head the user varies the amount pressure used laying down allowing all part the full weight the head and neck rest the thumbs the handles can also used sitting standing applying pressure with the arms wrists since wrists are also impaired typing this over extended period time and don have someone living with who can apply laying down works well for for back sit high backed kitchen chair position the massager behind whatever point want massaged and lean back lightly not lightly against the pressure leaning back holds place want massage the entire spine simply move down few inches whenever feel like for back this machine far superior use than the commonly used home made massager tennis balls taped together with the balls position against wall door them over the spine and move the body and down against them the tennis balls are better than nothing but difficult use for very long especially your quads are not good shape and long hair gets painfully the way don pin first far concerned the easier something like this use the more likely use there are multiple considerations hassles more likely not bother with not only has this machine helped with headaches but range motion for neck and back are greatly increased the first time used neck sub occipital muscles however overdid and pressed too hard against which resulted very tender almost bruised area for few days laid off for about days and applied ice which helped after that was more gradual about applying pressure this point the pain the sub occipital area now minimal while being massaged also learned use very light pressure lower back which the most vulnerable point for also eased some painful knots tension between shoulder blades although again took few days massaging just few minutes time really work out highly recommend this product you have similar problems although cannot vouch for its durability seems pretty sturdy since had such short time plan use not only ease tension but also loosen the muscls before exercising and maybe after too have been ill recently and not able exercise much for few weeks this was very timely for this the 1st product ordered from this company and only recently became aware thru worker the catalog states they have been business since 1976 contains quite few health care products and while they appear more expensive than the average health care catalog products they also appear much higher quality with more thought put into what they actually definitely step above some other ones seen such leonards health care catalog mature wisdom only but have ended some geriatric type mailing lists big surprise here consider many those products rip offs particularly targeted toward the elderly with dubious health benefits apologize for the length this but the kind info _i_ would like know before ordering something thru the mail robin coutellier northern telecom mountain view internet robin ntmtv com uucp portal ntmtv robin
