ch more the energy and they cool down the steam get least the energy that carnot will give them the cooling towers are for cooling the steam the vapor you see not the steam the main core circulation because that steam radioactive the circulation divided least circuits connected about heat exchangers prevent radioactive pollution the environment 2nd the main core hot but even the modernst hightemperature reactors htr they only run 800 deg celsius this still verry far away from uraniums melting point which somewhere around 2000 deg celsius but you have lot problems with the boiler steel that because this temperature the metal attacked steam and will corrode verry fast this only for bwr the new cooled reactors have temperatures 1200 deg celsius but this only experimental 3rd personaly think that nuclear waste should low ever possible because the dose you get will accumulate about the years today mrem and next year mrem won mrem all accumulates and even years you still have mrem and not interested glowing the night and getting children with heads this point view only christian reisel student electronic sciences christian reisel goldammerweg 6601 buebingen germany voice 6805 22179 fax email 6805 22179 pgp pubkey begin 777 pcr pub mf5l 296es96pl fes p7r5 f0qy1q_ dz0l mmo 6mx h5kl 5fi6 end
