es threat irreversible brain damage olney research with lab animals does not show anything about human youngsters fact only under extreme circumsrtances did olney experiments ever bring about any brain damage when injected extremely high doses msg into rodents completely bypassing their digestive tracts and entering their bloodstreams more directly and when used tubes force feed huge amounts the substance very young animals empty stomach course neither those procedures occurs with humans they simply take msg with food and most what they take broken down enzymes the wall the small intestine that very little reaches the bloodstream much little fact for human blood levels msg come anywhere near the high concentrations found olney lab animals the world health organization appears very much aware that fact and does the european communities scientific committee for food both after examining numerous studies have concluded that msg safe their determination makes sense considering that msg has never been proven cause all the symptoms that have been attributed headaches swelling tightness the chest and burning sensation among others fact the most fail safe clinical studies the double blind study has consistently exonerated the much maligned substance that quite fortunate since the alleged hazardous component monosodium glutamate glutamate enters our systems whenever eat any food that contains protein the reason that one the amino acids that make protein glutamic acid broken down into glutamate during digestion breakdown that occurs frequently glutamic acid the most abundant the amino acids the diet makes about percent the protein flesh foods percent milk percent corn and percent whole wheat that doesn mean entirely unimaginable that small number people have trouble metabolizing msg properly and are therefore sensitive the consensus reached large international professional organizations that msg safe the same consensus reached the fda and the biomedical community large rich young these are not kodak opinions
