sing kirlian photography possible show aura around people fingers notably around those healers who are concentrating healing someone normally blue and white rays emanate from the fingers but when subject becomes angry excited the aura turns red and spotty the soviets are now using kirlian photography diagnose diseases which cannot diagnosed any other method they argue that most illnesses there preclinical stage during which the person isn actually ill but about they claim able foretell disease photographing its preclinical phase but the most exciting phenomenon illustrated kirlian photography the phantom effect during high frequency photography leaf from which part had been cut the photograph gave complete picture the leaf with the removed part showing faintly this extremely important because backs the experiences psychics who can see the legs amputees they were still there the important thing about the kirlian phantoms though that the electromagnetic pattern can possibly represent secondary phenomenon the field would vanish when the piece leaf leg vanished the energy grid contained living object must therefore far more significant than the actual object itself kirlian photography has shown how water mentally charged healer has much richer energy field around than ordinary water from the incredulous side macrobert alan reality shopping consumer guide new age hokum _whole earth review_ autumn 1986 vnon4 excellent article providing common sense guidelines for evaluating paranormal claims and some the author favorite examples hokum the crank usually works isolation from everyone else his field study making grand discoveries his basement many paranormal movements can traced back such people kirlian photography for instance you pump high voltage electricity into anything will emit glowing sparks common knowledge electrical workers and hobbyists for century took lone basement crank declare that the sparks represent some sort spiritual aura fact kirlian photography was subjected rigorous testing physicists john pehek harry kyler and david faust who reported their findings the october 1976 issue science their conclusion the variations observed kirlian photographs are due solely moisture the surface the body and not mysterious auras even necessarily changes mood mental state nevertheless television shows magazines and books many famous parapsychologists continue promote kirlian photography proof the unknown peter kaminski kaminski netcom com
