3 |text from tomh metrics com tom haapanen subject rfd comp windows misc setup organization software metrics inc lines nntp posting host rodan net this the official request for discussion rfd for the creation two new newsgroups for microsoft windows this second rfd replacing the one originally posted january and never taken vote the proposed groups are described below name comp windows setup status unmoderated purpose discussions about setting and installing windows and about system and peripheral compatability issues for windows name comp windows misc status unmoderated purpose miscellaneous non programming discussions about using windows including issues such security networking features console mode and windows win16 compatability rationale microsoft the newest member the microsoft windows family operating systems operating environments for those who wish argue about the meaning the family ranges from modular windows through windows and windows for workgroups windows the high end date microsoft has shipped over 000 beta copies and pre release sdks windows the actual release slated for may june while windows has entirely new design internally shares application programming interface with the other members the windows family its win32 api includes the win16 api used win dows and the win32s api subset win32 less threads networking and security can used create bit applications for windows the user interface also practically identical that windows with the addition logins and few other features uses program manager file manager and other applets and generally pre sents identical appearance the user many the announced windows applications are ports existing windows apps and also runs existing applications thus appears logical that windows should share the following groups with the other members the windows family comp windows apps comp windows programmer tools comp windows programmer misc comp windows programmer win32 the following groups are also clearly applicable windows well windows comp windows announce comp windows advocacy conclusion the only clear argument for the separation the windows and windows hierarchies different internal structures windows and windows and yet operating systems such macintosh xenix and coherent all have undergone major rewrites without having been split into separate newsgroup hierarchies further windows due for major rewrite itself 1994 when the fully bit protected mode and with dos built next generation windows chicago debuts next year surely should remain the same hierarchy and what then would the jus tification for separating windows from other windows versions discussion period the discussion period will run from april 1992 may 1993 voting the cfv call for votes will issued around may 1993 based the feedback received during the discussion period votes will accepted prior the cfv tom haapanen tomh metrics com software metrics inc waterloo ont stick your index fingers into both corners your mouth now pull that how the corrado makes you feel car january
