st may the best way reach few them willing suffer reliability for speed and looks seems you have pay big buck you want all three anyway can anyone please let know how you like your talon and any problems you may have had and the repairs are worth humor_impaired skip_to theend matter how much you pay you won get all three examples nsx reliability and looks ferrari reliability yeah right speed and looks theend the opinions stated above are not necessarily employer roberto landrau kc1yp landrau mitre org rll linus mitre org the mitre corporation bedford 01730 rll linus uucp
