visualization section 384 digital image animation lab entertained and delighted the group everyone donned goggles view images mars project scientist eric jong showed off the latest data comet that had only recently been discovered orbit close jupiter hawking was curious about its composition and was shown how images are developed asked several questions their interpretation norman haynes ald office telecommunications and data acquisition briefed the professor the space flight operations facility and then hawking spoke with stone the day ended with two technical discussions particular interest the professor technical group leader frank estabrook and senior research scientist hugo wahlquist described three spacecraft gravity wave experiment currently under way then planetary astronomer richard terrile explained the philosophy and plans for extra solar system planetary detection the hawking party which had been visiting southern california for five weeks was headquartered caltech and planned leave for england within few weeks after the lab tour upon departing the cambridge based scientist promised chahine that would return jpl for another visit ___ _____ ___ ____ ron baalke baalke kelvin jpl nasa gov jet propulsion lab ___ 525 3684 telos the aweto from new zealand ___ ___ pasadena 91109 part caterpillar and _____ _____ part vegetable
