ds off one one following the erzincan massacre the armenians began withdraw towards erzurum the armenian renegades among those who withdrew erzurum from erzincan raided the moslem villages the road and destroyed the entire population together with the villages during the transportation the cannons ammunition and the carriages that were outside the war area certain people were hired among the kurdish population conduct the horse carriages while the travellers were passing through erzurum the armenians took advantage the time when the russian soldiers were their dwellings and began kill the kurds they had hired when the russian soldiers heard the cries the dying kurds they attempted help them however the armenians threatened the russian soldiers vowing that they would have the same fate they intervened and thus prevented them from acting all these terrifying acts slaughter were committed with hatred and loathing lieutenant medivani from the russian army described incident that witnessed erzurum follows armenian had shot kurd the kurd fell down but did not die the armenian attempted force the stick his hand into the mouth the dying kurd however since the kurd had firmly closed his jaws his agony the armenian failed his attempt having seen this the armenian ripped open the abdomen the kurd disembowelled him and finally killed him stamping him with the iron heel his boot odishelidge himself told that all the turks who could not escape from the village ilica were killed their heads had been cut off axes also told that had seen thousands murdered children lieutenant colonel gryaznov who passed through the village ilica three weeks after the massacre told the following there were thousands dead bodies hacked pieces the roads every armenian who happened pass through these roads cursed and spat the corpses the courtyard mosque which was about 25x30 meter square dead bodies were piled height 140 centimeters among these corpses were men and women every age children and old peop