6 |text from rlee ssdc ssdc sterling com richard lee subject pulldown menu periodically hangs application openwindows organization sterling software imd vienna lines distribution inet nntp posting host ssdc ssdc sterling com newsreader tin version pl6 skip koppenhaver skip eco twg com wrote has anyone found fix for the following problem client software sunos x11r5 server hardware sun ipc server software sunos open windows patch 100444 motif application will periodically hang when run against the openwindows server xnews the pulldown displayed but then button actions have any effect sometimes pressing return will unstick the application but not usually looks like the pulldown grabbing the focus and never letting other windows the display continue get updated the server isn hanging log from another terminal and kill the motif application then everything gets back normal the same application when run against other servers including mit x11r5 xsun decwindows tektronix terminal has problems this obviously openwindows problem but need work around since most our customers are openwindows users have seen the same problem using sparcstation solaris case happens far more often than periodically help
13 |text from edhall rand org hall subject los angeles freeway traffic reports organization rand lines nntp posting host ives rand org article c5ulqn gpw com cfb com charlie brett writes while driving through the middle nowhere picked knx 1070 clear channel station based los angeles they had claiming that they were able get traffic flow information from all the thousands traffic sensors that caltrans has placed under the pavement does caltrans sell this info does knx have exclusive what the deal well they claim they are the only radio broadcaster with this information but the city cable channel cablevision areas shows this information map during travel times 9am and 7pm believe most the major freeways are covered the computer generated map shows green yellow red flashing red respectively 40mph 40mph 25mph and incident might off little the speeds since this from memory often look this display the morning see really want fight the traffic the sepulveda pass work from home for little while wait for clear another poster explained the origin the information sensors embedded wire loops the pavement near ramps and every half mile caltrans has had big board driven from this data their traffic control center for some time don know they are selling the data anyone with the equipment necessary for its transmission and display can have hall edhall rand org
6 |text from tmcconne sedona intel com tom mcconnell subject motif athena etc organization intel corporation lines distribution world nntp posting host thunder intel com originator tmcconne sedona article c5k6ny azj kirk bambi kirk david hughes writes berry durian citr andrew berry writes ports motif both 386bsd and linux are available for fee about 100 this cost recovery for the person who bought the rights redistribute the activity both the bsd and linux news groups pertaining motif has been high just wonder this will also cause divergence between commercial and non commercial software you will only get free software using athena openlook widget sets and only get commercial software using the motif widget sets can see why just about every workstation will come with motif default and you can buy for under 100 for the free unix platforms can see this causing major problems let add another concerns yes can buy port motif for cheap but cannot get the source for cheap hence limited using whatever libraries the motif port was compiled against least with older versions motif have been told that motif can used with any but have not seen myself currently have x11r5 running eight different unix platforms which only three came with motif those three unable use the x11r5 libraries build motif clients because get link errors between the vendor supplied port motif and x11r5 anticipate having this same problem when x11r6 becomes available the result that cannot build motif clients that rely x11r5 since not have motif compiled under x11r5 true could buy another port motif but that sort ruins the whole idea free doesn cheers tom mcconnell tom mcconnell internet tmcconne sedona intel com intel corp phone 602 554 8229 5000 chandler blvd the opinions expressed are own one chandler 85226 their right mind would claim them
