e had problems whatsoever have noticed slowdown other than takes little longer boot either windows dos far very happy camper bruce bruce steinke never know when you going bsteinke dsd com need good piece rope software technical support engineer sam gamgee evans sutherland computer corp mail opinions have been using doubledisk gold for little more than month 486dx 33mhz 120mb seagate drive running dos windows 386 enhanced mode ran some tests and concluded that the speed doubledisk drive with drive read cache about equal the bare drive without cache have complaints about reliability was very easy install the only problem had was with castle wolfenstein assumed the game was trying bypass dos disk access and moved the game the non compressed region the disk since then the game has never given problem there was never any damage the doubledisk drive compression performance for the whole disk has held steady around this lower than expected but about size files are compressed image files and some large zip files you have any more specific questions let know dan bought have been happy with use both mfm and ide drives was using doubledisk before gold came out that the same product msdos shipping with problems with either product ron bjornseth bjornset pogo den mmc com end messages
