rectly verifying the existence science has not historically progressed any sort rational experiment data theory sequence most experiments are carried out and interpreted pre existing theoretical frameworks the theoretical controversies the day determine which experiments get done overall there huge messy affair personal jealousies crazy motivations petty hatreds and the like that determines which experiments and which computations get done what keeps going forward the critical function science results don count unless they can replicated the whole system sort mechanism for generate and test the generate part can totally irrational long the test part works properly pasteur could believe whatever liked about chemical activity and crystals but even mitscherlich had agree that racemic acid crystals were handed that when you separate them handedness you get two chemicals that rotate polarized light opposite directions and the right rotating version was indistinguishable from tartaric acid pasteur irrational motivation had led replicable and important result this where lysenko creationists etc fail they have usually not even produced coherent theories that predict much anything when their theories predict and are contradicted experiment they not concede the point and modify their theories rather they try suppress the results lysenko try divert attention other evidence they think supports their position creationists mark fulk university rochester computer science department fulk rochester edu
