lion and million year nearly twice much any other player the league who the new commissioner the nhl gary bettman vice president and general counsel the national basketball association was named commissioner the national hockey league friday december 1992 bettman joined the nba 1981 assistant general counsel became the league chief legal officer september 1984 new york resident bettman graduated from cornell university 1974 and from new york university school law 1977 how many professional hockey leagues are there north america six national american international east coast central and colonial hockey leagues miscellaneous for field hockey discussions the newsgroup rec sport hockey field for skating discussions the newsgroup rec skate some sites get another hockey group called clari sports hockey consists the upi feed for all upi news articles that are related hockey including game results summaries scores standings etc much the information the nhl team news section comes from this newsgroup the rec sport hockey frequently asked questions posting posted semi monthly usually the 1st and 15th each month during the hockey season this file was originally created tom wilson who posted during the 1991 season was taken over mitch mcgowan for the 1992 season please make corrections via mail indicating faq the subject line feel free start discussion any previously mentioned topic but use appropriate subject line mitch mcgowan hamlet washington edu
