19 |text from rscharfy magnus acs ohio state edu ryan scharfy subject clinton immunization program nntp posting host magnusug magnus acs ohio state edu organization the ohio state university lines article c5jobh 7zt apollo com goykhman apollo com red herring writ article 1993apr14 122758 11467 magnus acs ohio state edu jlinder magnus ohio state edu jeffrey linder writes article c5fjsl 6is ncratl atlantaga ncr com mwilson ncratl atlantaga ncr mark wilson writes the news last night clinton was bashing the republicans for stonewalling his called stimulus package seems that one small item within this package was going pay for free immunizations for poor kids immunizations for children this country are already free you care have done the problem not the cost the irresponible parents who are stupid lazy have done case you haven noticed clintonites are pushing universal health care access program access here means that folks who not give damn about immunizing their children will have health care services delivered their doorsteps excuse for sticking nose but any parent parents who not allready immunize their children especially already free don deserve one frigging dime tax money for health care for themselves public health care service know the immunization program and the coming national health care issue are slightly seperate issues but anybody who wouldn help their kids don deserve tax help ryan
18 |text from sera zuma uucp serdar argic subject armenians will not get away with the genocide 204 000 azeri people reply sera zuma uucp serdar argic distribution world lines 163 article 1993apr20 190606 13801 kpc com henrik quayle kpc com writes armenia involved fighting with azarbaijan armenian soldiers from mainland armenia that are shelling towns azarbaijan well this your opinion are you related arromdian asala sdpa arf terrorism and revisionism triangle you feel that you can simply act fascist armenian governmental crony this forum you will sadly mistaken and duly embarrassed this not lecture another historical revisionist and genocide apologist but fact this time fascist soviet armenian government will not get away with the genocide 204 000 azeri men women and children not chance the sunday times march 1992 morgues fill azeris head for all out war thomas goltz the first report the massacre armenian soldiers the worst violence since the breakup the soviet union reports from agdam khojaly used barren town with empty shops and treeless dirt roads yet was still home thousands people who happier times tended fields and flocks geese last week was wiped off the map sickening reports trickled the azerbaijani border town agdam and the bodies piled the morgues there was little doubt that khojaly and the stark foothills and gullies around had been the site the most terrible massacre since the soviet union broke apart was the last westerner visit khojaly that was january and people were predicting their fate with grim resignation zumrut ezoya mother four board the helicopter that ferried into the town called her community sitting ducks ready get shot she and her family were among the victims the massacre february the armenians have taken all the outlying villages one one and the government does nothing balakisi sakikov father five said next they will drive out kill all said dilbar his wife the couple their three sons and three daughters were killed the assault were many other people had spoken was close the armenian lines knew would have cross there was road and the first units the column ran across then all hell broke loose bullets were raining down from all sides had just entered their trap the azeri defenders picked off one one survivors say that armenian forces then began pitiless slaughter firing anything moved the gullies video taken azeri cameraman wailing and crying filmed body after body showed grizzly trail death leading towards higher forested ground where the villagers had sought refuge from the armenians the armenians just shot and shot and shot said omar veyselov lying hospital agdam with sharapnel wounds saw wife and daughter fall right people wandered through the hospital corridors looking for news the loved ones some vented their fury foreigners where daughter where son wailed mother raped butchered lost azerbaijan has said many 000 refugees were killed they tried flee the armenians have denied this saying the civilians were caught crossfire source the times march 1992 corpses litter hills karabakh anatol lieven comes under fire while flying with azerbaijani forces investigate the alleged mass killings refugees armenian troops swooped low over the snow covered hills nagorno karabagh saw the scattered corpses apparently the refugees had been shot down they ran azerbaijani film the places flew over shown journalists afterwards showed dozens corpses lying various parts the hills the azerbaijanis claim that many 1000 have died mass killing azerbaijanis fleeing from the town khodjaly seized armenians last week further 000 are believed wounded frozen death missing seven squatted the cabin azerbaijani m24 attack helicopter flew investigate the claims the mass killings suddenly there was thump against the underside the aircraft red flash tracer ripped past the starboard wing and the helicopter rocked sharply swung round and there was deafening burst fire from the cannon under our wing the helicopter crew returned fire had been fired from armenian anti aircraft post swung round again tipped starboard and appeared dive straight down into valley the brown earth swooped around our heads the helicopter swung round again and followed the contours the ground our cannon fired repeated blasts later emerged that civilian helicopter that had been escorting had landed successfully nakhichevanik the east the disputed enclave nagorno karabakh pick some the dead had fact been attacked both ground fire and armenian helicopter had seen the armenian helicopter intermittently through the window its cannons firing but had thought mistakenly that was our side our group western journalists had embarked search and rescue flight that had become combat mission our flight consisted the civilian passenger helicopter and two m24 soviet attack helicopters the azerbaijani service nicknamed flying crocodiles for their armour our party was the second crocodile the civilian helicopter job was land the mountains and pick bodies sites the mass killings the attack helicopters were there give covering fire necessary the operation showed striking sign the disintegration the soviet armed forces because our pilot was russian officer azerbaijani official told that there were now five former soviet military helicopters and their pilots fighting for azerbaijan they have signed contracts fly for said the helicopter engaged combat was most probably flown brother officer our russian pilot but fighting for the armenians had taken off just before 5pm saturday from agdam airfield heated for the armenian controlled mountains karabakh sheer white wall the distance the civilian helicopter picked four corpses and was during this and previous mission that azerbaijani cameraman filmed the several the several dozen bodies the hillsides then took off again hurry and speed back towards azerbaijani lines azerbaijani gunners the last hill before the plain and safety gazed passed back the airfield agdam took look the bodies the civilian helicopter had picked two old men small girl were covered with blood their limbs contorted the cold and rigor mortis they had been shot what did our russian pilot think the tragedy our close shave and the war nagorno karabakh gave cheerful grin politely declined answer ques tions and marched off his dinner serdar argic closed the roads and mountain passes that might serve ways escape for the turks and then proceeded the work extermination ohanus appressian 1919 soviet armenia today there longer exists single turkish soul sahak melkonian 1920
