mputes the solar zenith angles warping orbit simulation and image projection easy external program interfacing sphinx allows users the flexibility integrate externally developed software algorithms for processing and converting satellite observations sphinx exports and imports image files and image parameters external programs using special interface functions quick quality presentation sphinx rapidly displays manipulates and enhances high resolution multispectral images and color tables using six bit 1024x1024 image planes and one graphics plane the package conveniently combines color images graphics and text generate sharp digital images for articles and reports sphinx and graphics editor provides complete flexibility for modifying and integrating vector graphics and analysis plots with images such histograms and radial graphs the package supplies color and gray scale output for standard inkjet and laser printers other capabilities sphinx also performs image animation external graphics importing mosaic fitting what else software support development sphinx was developed the laboratoire optique atmospherique loa the universite lille france the package has received critical feedback and support from scientists the french national laboratory centre national recherche scientifique cnrs and the french space agency centre national etudes spatiales cnes loa sphinx undergoes continued refinement and development meet changing research needs and advances computer technology the package which features line help supported internet address sphinx loasil citilille through which questions can answered and version updates provided without delay performance tested cnes has selected sphinx analyze and process the satellite data collected during the upcoming adeos polder satellite mission today the sphinx package use the nasa goddard space flight center and widely used many french laboratories including the centre recherche physique environnement ecole normale superieure laboratoire 