es change the mode binary and send put your files note that you won able see the files with the dir commands please compress your files appropriate the operating system zip for msdos compactor something similar for macintosh save disk space after uploading please send email steve clancy slclancy uci edu for msdos albert saisho saisho uci edu for mac describing the file you have uploaded and any other information might need describe note that can only accept software information that has been designated shareware public domain that may otherwise distributed freely please not upload commercial software doing may jeopardize the existence this ftp site you wish upload software for other operating systems please contact either steve clancy albert saisho the addresses above hicnet medical newsletter page volume number april 1993 aids news summaries aids daily summary the centers for disease control and prevention cdc national aids clearinghouse makes available the following information public service only providing this information does not constitute endorsement the cdc the cdc clearinghouse any other organization reproduction this text encouraged however copies may not sold copyright 1993 information inc bethesda april 1993 nih set test multiple aids vaccines reuters frank jacqueline washington the clinton administration will permit the national institutes health test multiple aids vaccines instead only allowing the army test single vaccine administration sources said thursday the decision ends the controversy between army aids researchers who had hoped test vaccine made microgenesys inc and the national institutes health which contended that multiple vaccines should tested health and human services secretary donna shalala said final announcement the therapeutic vaccine trials was expected made last friday companies including genentech inc chiron corp and immuno have already told nih that they are prepared participate the vaccine tests the testing intended demonstrate whether aids vaccines are effective thwarting the replication hiv patients already infected shalala refuted last week reports that the clinton administration had decided the army test the microgenesys vaxsyn should proceed without tests others the same time the report was inaccurate and expect there some announcement the next hours about that particular aids research project said shalala administration sources subsequently confirmed that nih director bernadine healy and food and drug administration commissioner david kessler had convinced the white house that multiple vaccines should tested simultaneously but microgenesys president frank volvovitz said test multiple vaccines could triple the cost the trial and delay two years hicnet medical newsletter page volume number april 1993 the limits azt impact hiv news world report vol 114 azt has become the most widely used drug fight aids since was approved the food and drug administration 1987 burroughs wellcome the manufacturer azt made 338 million last year alone from sales the drug however team european researchers recently reported that although hiv positive patients taking azt demonstrated slightly lower risk developing aids within the first year treatment that benefit disappeared two years later the lancet published preliminary findings the three year study which could give more reason for critics argue the drug cost side effects and general efficacy even though researchers concede the study was more comprehensive than american trials many argue the european researchers suggestion that hiv positive patients experience little improvement their illness before the development aids symptoms addition researchers have long been familiar with the end part internet david stat com fax 602 451 1165 bitnet atw1h asuacad fidonet 114 amateur packet ax25 wb7tpy wb7tpy usa
