9 |text from russell hughes dartmouth edu rph subject power arc ignition super carb posted from internews 0b14 dartmouth edu organization hog heaven lines now the bike off warranty finally replaced the stock items softail custom with the title ones installation was pretty easy both cases even for fairly non mechanical chemist type dude like discovered the limitations tool collection but had fun buying and making the requisite tools ignitions power arc single fire ignition easy install but read the wiring diagram carefully setting the static timing was piece cake once installed have found easier starting smoother idle and more power plus more satisfying bass note the exhaust register lovely whompa whompa whompa idle the folks ignitions were great answering dumb questions the phone very helpful bunch guys with great product super carb installation easy once hacked down allen wrench small anough reach get the intake manifold bolts tunes like dream just like they say the stock carb non adjustable was lean that was gasping and spluttering for gas sometimes and even backfiring into the intake manifold the super terrific hesitation any gear and plugs are lovely tan color with need rejet from the factory settings know this may not seem like much you grizzled veteran wrenchers out there but had bike many pieces this weekend began get worried but all went back together again and runs like dream feeling pretty happy now all have install bub pipes and try pass the noise gestapo test russ hughes fxstc dod 6022 10e20 love yeah that the feeling you get when you like something much your motorcycle sonny barger
