15 |text subject space faq network resources from leech unc edu jon leech expires may 1993 gmt organization university north carolina chapel hill keywords frequently asked questions supersedes net_730956391 unc edu nntp posting host mahler unc edu lines 241 archive name space net last modified date network resources overview you may reading this document any one amazing variety computers much the material below may not apply you general however systems connected the net fall one three categories internet usenet bitnet electronic mail may sent between these networks and other resources available one these networks are sometimes accessible from other networks email sent special servers the space and astronomy discussion groups actually are composed several mechanisms with mostly transparent connections between them one mechanism the mailing list which mail sent central distribution point which relays all recipients the list addition the general lists for space called space digest for internet users and space bitnet there are number more specialized mailing lists described below second mechanism usenet netnews this somewhat like bulletin board operating each system which part the net netnews separates contributions into hundreds different categories based group name the groups dealing most closely with space topics are called sci space news sci space sci space shuttle sci astro and talk politics space contributors post submissions called articles netnews terminology their local machine which sends other nearby machines similarly articles sent from nearby machines are stored locally and may forwarded other systems that article posted locally and eventually reaches all the usenet sites interested receiving the news group which the article was posted gateway machines redirect the usenet sci space group into internet and bitnet mailing lists and vice versa the other usenet groups are not accessible mailing lists you can receive netnews its more flexible interface and access wider range material usually make the preferred option mailing lists space digest the main internet list and now being run the international space university only its second change management over decade email space request isu isunet edu message body should the format subscribe space john public join note that the moderated space magazine list defunct present for lack moderator old copies space digest since its inception 1981 are available anonymous ftp retrieve julius qub pub spacedigestarchive readme for further details elements moderated list for fast distribution space shuttle keplerian elements before and during shuttle flights nasa two line elements are sent out the list from kelso jsc and other sources they are released email elements request telesoft com join gps digest moderated list for discussion the global positioning system and other satellite navigation positioning systems email gps request esseye com join space investors list for information relevant investing space related companies email vincent cate vac cmu edu join space tech list for more technical discussion space topics discussion has included esoteric propulsion technologies asteroid capture starflight orbital debris removal etc email space tech request cmu edu join archives old digests and selected excerpts are available anonymous ftp from gs80 cmu edu 128 205 usr anon public space tech email space tech request you don have ftp access seds bitnet list for members students for the exploration and development space and other interested parties email listserv tamvm1 bitnet with message saying subscribe seds your name email saying index seds list the archive contents sedsnews bitnet list for news items press releases shuttle status reports and the like this duplicates material which also found space digest sci space sci space shuttle and sci astro email listserv tamvm1 bitnet saying subscribe sedsnews your name join email saying index sedsnews list the archive contents ron baalke baalke kelvin