e weapon around hip level and fired didn bring the weapon eye level saw bill arm going back and knew had been hit cooper fired harris and harris went down cooper then brought his weapon bear samuel but did not fire this point cooper then heard two shots his right samuel weaver looked the direction the shots yelled you son bitch and ran toward them cooper then realized that shots were coming him from directly ahead fired three round burst the cabin this point then saw samuel weaver running toward the cabin when cooper reached degan placed his first two fingers degan carotid artery counted two three beats and then his heart stopped shortly thereafter roderick and the other three marshals joined him they then all heard large burst gunfire from the area around the cabin cross examination david nevin questioned the point throwing rocks into the gulley asking you wanted lure that dog out you could shoot that dog didn you nevin also pointed out that last september testimony cooper had claimed that spotted weaver after the dog had left him cooper claimed that had gone over the events his head and decided that thursday account was correct nevin continued the cross examination asking what cooper would have done had armed man dressed full camouflage jumped out the woods him answer was available friday april marks continued cross examination cooper notes there was coverage protestors drew ron phillips crphilli hound dazixca ingr com senior customer engineer intergraph electronics 381 east evelyn avenue voice 415 691 6473 mountain view 94041 fax 415 691 0350
