7 |text from smb col com sam bauer subject for sale waxworks organization colorado springs division lines nntp posting host hpctdib col com game for sale waxworks horrorsoft accolade the same folks who brought you elvira played elvira and think that horrorsoft has finally made very playable game with waxworks the look and feel roughly the same the elvira games though the real time fighting little easier survive the first two games especially elvira jaws cerberus made very tough stay alive and hit point restoring was very difficult this not say that waxworks walk the park but quite fair that there always some weapon found that quite effective hint given the proper fighting strategy one the four wax works explored there fighting all well almost none though all four contain moderately challanging puzzles the really interesting thing about this game that really broken into four seperate rpgs one for each the four exhibits you must enter starting each one your character transported with objects use and experience level one exhibits traps you inside multi level ancient egyptian pyramid which you must escape fighting mapping and puzzle solving another exhibit traps you mine that has been taken over creeping plant vines and pods while the local humans have been transformed into plant zombies this single level maze that requires you rescue some humans kill the head plant alien and figuere out how kill the very tuff plant zombies that are always showing this perhaps the most horrifying exhibit another exhibit puts you into jack the ripper england where you appear the corpse fresh ripper victim and course the police think you are responsible you must avoid police and angry mobs unravel the mystery the ripper and meet him face face but first get disquise the last exhibit pus you graveyard where most the challenge learning stop the almost indestructible zombies over all the vga graphics and music are very effective setting creepy tone for the game was the case for the elvira games though gameplay much improved and makes for much more enjoyable game heartily recommend for rpg and horror fans all prices include shipping all games are excellent condition unless otherwise stated buyers only please all games will shipped inside box with packing insured priority usps all games include all original materials including box manual disks and registration unless otherwise noted the first responder offering asking price guarenteed get the game those just asking questions get priority until they offer buy the game lower offers may considered assuming other offers asking price are made sam bauer hewlett packard 719 531 4460 network test division smb col com colorado springs
