 p3d without ever looking the underlying lisp the p3d software currently supports nine renderers they are painter painter algorithm dore silicon graphics inc language generic phigs sun phigs dec phigs rayshade art ray tracer from vort package and pixar renderman the code available via anonymous ftp from the machines ftp psc edu directory pub p3d and nic funet directory pub graphics programs p3d renderman pixar renderman not free call pixar for details solids description formats eec esprit project 322 cad cad interfaces has developed neutral file format for transfer cad data curves surfaces and solid models between cad systems and from cad caa computer aided analysis cam computer aided manufacturing iges now tries define standard tranfer solid models brep and csg the current standard number ansi y14 26m 1987 for documentation you might want contact nancy flower ncga technical services and standards 800 225 6242 ext 325 and the cost 100 this standard not available electronic format pdes step this slowly emerging standard tries encompass not only the geometrical information but also for things like fem etc the main bodies besides this standard are nist and darpa you can get more information about pdes sending mail nptserver cme nist gov and putting the line send index the body not the subject area the message the people rutherford appleton lab are also working step tools they have express compiler and exchange file parser both available source form and for free for research purposes soon they will also have express based database system for the tools contact mike mead phone 0235 6710 fax 5893 mail inf mcsun uknet rlinf inf nsfnet relay end part the resource listing nick nikolaos fotis national technical univ athens greece home esperidon internet nfotis theseas ntua halandri 152 uucp mcsun ariadne theseas nfotis athens greece fax 578
