ed hoping that seen some essential part the control mechanism for eukaryotic genes this fantasy led him sequence samples the band and carry out binding assays the result was well conserved 400 sequence that occurs about 500 000 times the human genome unfortunately for warren fantasy turns out transposon that present many copies because replicates itself and copies itself back into the genome the other hand the characteristics transposons were much elucidated the necessity cellular reverse transcriptase was recognized and the standard method recognizing human dna was created other species have different sets transposons fortunately for warren and used eat dinner fridays all the time have agree with gary merrill response this read alot the alu and middle repetitive sequence work and really very interesting good work with implications for many fields molecular genetics really example how well reasoned project turned interesting results that were unexpected mike
