8 |text from welty cabot balltown cma com richard welty subject rec autos welcome the new reader keywords monthly posting reply welty balltown cma com organization new york state institute for sebastian cabot studies expires thu may 1993 gmt lines 269 archive name rec autos part1 most recent changes march 1993 addition alt autos karting rpw welcome rec autos this article sent out automatically each month and contains general description the purpose each the automotive newsgroups and some suggested guidelines for discussions the keywords monthly posting will always appear make killing this article easy for users newsreaders with kill facilities this article posted all autos groups but followups are directed only rec autos you don understand what this means ask your system administrator for help least for copies the newuser documentation failing that please subscribe the newsgroup news announce newusers and read the documentation provided there introduction the rec autos newsgroup hierarchy rec autos tech intended for technical discussions automobiles their design construction diagnosis and service other discussions are largely inappropriate especially for sale ads rec autos sport intended for discussion legal organized competition involving automobiles technical discussions are appropriate insofar they apply competition vehicles discussion from either two viewpoints spectator and participant encouraged arguments about sports cars are largely inappropriate are most other discussions for sale ads are inappropriate unless they are for competition vehicles and equipment discussions illegal events are marginal one should probably avoid advocating breaking the law remember the fbi reads usenet rec autos driving intended for discussions related the driving automobiles also you must discuss radar detectors insert your pet driving peeve boneheads here rec autos intended for discussion issues related the use and ownership automobiles manufactured volkswagen this includes vws audis seats etc was created the grounds that the info mailing list was very successful should not presumed from the existence this group that appropriate create many groups cover many different marques groups specific individual marques should only created demonstration sufficient interest via some avenue such mailing list rec audio car not properly part the rec autos hierarchy however the correct place for discussion automotive audio equipment and mentioned here rec autos antique intended for the discussion older cars usually more than years old although this not hard and fast rule alt hotrod not part the hierarchy but also potential interest the rec autos reader gatewayed the moderated hotrod mailing list and for serious discussion modifying and developing performance vehicles alt autos rod custom also not part the official hierarchy devoted that peculiar american hobby customizing older cars alt autos karting for the discussion the popular motorsport and hobby karting rec autos intended capture discussion all other automotive topics crossposting crossposting occurs when more than one newsgroup name included the newsgroups line the article header such articles will appear all the newsgroups listed crossposting one the most misunderstood and misused facilities usenet you should only post group because you feel article appropriate you should never crosspost just reach particular audience this distinction subtle but important radar detector articles for example are more less appropriate rec autos they are almost never appropriate sci electronics rec ham radio and the fact that you might want reach the audience sci electronics rec ham radio not adequate justification for posting either group crossposting between any all the rec autos groups usually inappropriate you find yourself doing consider whether not truly advisable before sending your article consider setting followup point only one newsgroup you feel you must crosspost crossposting between rec autos and misc consumers chancy best particular flame wars over the speed limit the and the use radar detectors should never crossposted between any these groups most readers sci electronics and rec radio couldn care less about the police radar and radar detector arguments that endlessly rec autos excellent idea check the newsgroups and followup lines articles before posting followup particular wary posting misc test rec arts startrek talk bizarre any combination these three the life you save may your own distribution there field the header any news article which allows you partially control where the article goes called the distribution field may very useful for many reasons should also serve reminder that news very large and widespread system the distribution rec autos fairly extensive this writing the automotive newsgroups are known reach most europe australia new zealand and some locations japan with this mind offer the following hints about use the distribution field your article headers and article content please take care not send for sale ads about clapped out ford mavericks new jersey france california doubt that anyone either place will care except for girlfriend who for some strange reason likes mavericks but only door mavericks that when posting technical questions please include the market for which your car was manufactured for example there are number differences between european market ford escort and market escort likewise all 1750cc and early 2000cc alfa romeos reached the with spica fuel injection european market cars usually got carbs often webers these differences can important your readers make your situation clear failure can lead pointless flame wars and significant spread misinformation careful about your capacities and specifications when posting the get mix metric and english system values whereas europe almost entirely the metric system future edition this monthly posting will contain list commonly used abbreviations that may not known some places that rec autos reaches this cuts both ways let not parochial about use the distribution field limit where your article goes when possible within north america the values north america can canada and usa may used addition the two letter state abbreviations the are supported some cases wanted send article only new york and new jersey could put distribution field note that multiple comma separated values are legal these distribution fields vary widely however you should check with your local sysadmin find out what likely supported your area the dangers overgeneralization amplify warning from the distribution section this article wary making foolish assumptions about all cars tires etc what true for 1973 buick with 455cid engine may quite utterly wrong for 1976 honda with 1200cc engine headlight laws sweden are decidedly different from those idaho the need for adequate specification when you ask question please give reasonable amount information you have question about your honda please specify year model engine size etc otherwise most answers your question may quite useless concerning lemons one time another every auto manufacturer has manufactured lemon two even honda admits this please don waste everyone time announcing the world that your brand automobile terrible all brand automobiles are terrible one should ever buy car from the brand company such articles are worse than useless because they cause substantial wasted bandwidth while carrying little useful information concerning flames much might wish flame free newsgroup something that most likely will never occur here are some guidelines for flames and how deal with them list flame prone topics follows the next section this posting you post something truly obnoxious and inflammatory don imagine for minute that including the words flames will work won and you get exactly what you deserve you going flame you more likely get away with you can cite fact maybe well known reference one likely believe bald unsupported assertions careful about who you choose insult consider not insulting anyone asking the question bad idea post question and end with phrase like please send email don read this group much better idea end the question with please send email there sufficient interest summarize the results later posting may miss posted responses this request answering the question someone wants hop their yugo don tell them get mustang either silent give them useful advice someone wants advice defending speeding ticket don tell them obey the law next time offensive presumes guilt which not proven and doesn directly address the original question general don post order see your words print and don post order enjoy feeling smug and self righteous stale and inflammatory topics certain topics are considered stale old timers while discussion them certainly and new factual information welcome ravings about them are extremely tiresome and may get the person who posts them ignored altogether some topics are naturally inflammatory difficult not impossible have meaningful discussion them some these topics include the following the 55mph speed limit the pro and con discussions about the morality and legality the sale and usage radar detectors discussions over which radar detector best discussions over what sports car this one reason why rec autos sport not sports car group everyone would argue about what constitutes sports car disputes over whether not federal law protects the driver right own and operate radar detector buy american discussions clever bumper stickers and personalized license plates insert nationality here cars are terrible what kind car did maxwell smart drive when have complete accurate answer will added the commonly asked questions article which also posted monthly until then please don waste bandwidth this topic rpw please direct comments and suggestions about this article welty cabot balltown cma com richard welty 518 393 7228 welty cabot balltown cma com nothing good has ever been reported about the full rotation race car about either its pitch roll axis carroll smith
