18 |text from dbd urartu sdpa org david davidian subject treatment armenians azerbaijan summary prelude events today organization center for regional studies lines 223 deposition vitaly nikolayevich danielian born 1972 attended 9th grade middle school resident building apartment microdistrict sumgait azerbaijan really people town didn know what was happening february came home from school clock being excused leave before the last period order baku when left everything town was fine life was the same usual few groups people were discussing things soccer and other things then got the sumgait bus bound for baku for first cousin birthday father mother and spent the day baku and the 28th somewhere around got the bus for home figuring that have enough time homework for the next day when were entering town near the story high rises our bus was stopped very large crowd the crowd demanded that the armenians get off the bus the driver says that there are armenians board then everyone the bus begins shout that there are armenians board the group comes the doors the bus and has people get out one one not checking passports just going the way people look get off the bus but are not taken for armenians set out the direction home first were going into old building where knew there place hide but the whole road was packed with groups people all the way from block the 8th microdistrict these groups were emptying people pockets and checking passports people who didn have passports with them were beaten well then decided home instead near the story high rises saw burning cars and great many people standing around the driveways yelling death the armenians was written the cars when came into the courtyard live shaped building was still quiet went upstairs but didn turn any lights tried call baku warn our relatives who were due arrive wednesday not come then there was knock the door was our neighbors who advised come down stay their place went down their place and they led the basement they live the first floor and have basement which you enter across the balcony sat the basement while armenian woman was beaten she ran away naked our neighbors daughter said that that right that what the armenians deserve because stepanakert allegedly people were being killed girls from agdam had been raped didn stay very long the basement tried support one another best could looking out the small window with the iron grating papa watched and said things now and then said that there was fire near building probably car fire then one the groups approached our driveway and demanded that they shown the apartments where armenians lived the neighbors said that there weren any armenians here and the group set out for the other wing the building they appeared from the side the building where later found out woman had been murdered the woman who ran away naked died yuri avakian was killed too when the crowd left the neighbors said that was all over and could home went back our place and again didn turn the light started gather our things order leave sumgait for while tried call relative who lived sumgait but there was answer decided she had already left sat home the phone rang and the caller asked speak with father called him the phone was jeykhun mamedov from father work brigade said was disgusted what was happening our town asked for our address and promised get car and help get out the city quite honest papa didn want give him our address but mother got the phone and told him some minutes after the call crowd ran into our entryway bursting into the building they broke down the door and came into the apartment they came straight our apartment they knew exactly where the armenians were they came into our place tried resist but there was nothing could one them took parents passports and began read them read the surname danielian turned the page read armenian and that alone was enough doom said that should moved quickly out into the courtyard where they would have done with another standing next him pushed some the keys the piano and said your death has tolled they had knives and steel truncheons had knife hand unfortunately didn use just knew that didn give the knife things would much worse they struck parents and said that should put the knife the piano then one them commanded that taken outside one person was giving orders when were taken outdoors went the middle and mother was behind someone started push her she walk faster let her ahead and fell behind her when tried push hit him and that moment they began beating parents realized that resistance was completely useless are taken out into the courtyard and the neighbors are standing their balconies see what will happen next the crowd surrounds first they strike and knocked out when come they beat again lose consciousness often don see hear parents since was the first one hit and was out cold when come try pick them they are lying next the crowd gone the only people around are watching from their balconies that try pick them but can left arm broken start toward the drive wanting tell the neighbors call ambulance the bodies parents are still warm were attacked around clock regain consciousness about and try make the stairs home when knock the neighbors door they push back and tell away the third floor our neighbor puts damp cloth head and says she will call ambulance she sends her son off for one and takes our apartment often look out the window see the ambulance has arrived but can see very far result the blows and seems that parents have already been taken away then calm down and try convince myself that they have been taken away and everything will but they were still there later the morning found out the ambulance picked them but they were already dead they received attention time possible they would still alive later around clock the 29th policemen civilian clothing come our house with some assistants they call ambulance and minutes later arrives and taken the sumgait emergency hospital there they stitch the wounds head and rebind arm clock and the other armenians who are the hospital are sent ambulance baku ward the sumgait hospital there were five people all them armenians the hospital was nearly overflowing with armenians the only azerbaijanis there were those whose car had flipped over before the events before the 27th then was the semashko hospital baku was there days when was released the 40th day found out that parents were dead first they told that they were moscow being treated but later found out that they were dead father older brother told father name was nikolai artemovich danielian was born 1938 mother born 1937 was seda osipovna danielian papa worked pmk the leader the roofing brigade mamma was compressor operator they were also beaten the head the coroner report stated that their heads were smashed open and bled profusely the confrontation met jeykhun mamedov who had called turned out later had been the one who tipped the crowd off had called specifically find out were home and find out the exact address and dispatch the group knew the phone number but didn know the address before the events had never seen him but had often spoken with him the phone when would ask speak with father knew him name denies that was the one who answered the phone saying that father answered denies that called from public phone saying that called from home which also isn true heard noise and the sounds automobiles later found out earlier had been convicted but had never served any time had received suspended sentence was about years old don know has since confessed not sure that was the one who tipped the crowd off one hundred percent sure parents were from karabagh father was from the village badar and was two years old when his family moved baku where his elder brothers were school was student the naval school but never graduated went off work the virgin lands one the gigantic agricultural projects instituted under khrushchev when returned lived