st solution give karabagh armenia return armenia since the people want live peacefully with the azerbaijanis but everything has right before they can that arrived karabagh april felt very bad had constant headaches after while strength returned older sister suzanna took think that justice should prevail the people are demanding their due you can take away what their due parents and often spoke nagorno karabagh often visited here spent almost all vacations here had even decided that karabagh would made part armenia would move here for sure always said that the armenian people had suffered much and that what had been done 1921 removing nagorno karabagh from armenia was wrong sooner later mistakes should corrected and order correct mistake must not repeated and the fate all nagorno karabagh lies the hands our government june 1988 stepanakert david davidian dbd urartu sdpa org how explain turkish troops center for regional studies the armenian border when can box 382761 even explain 1915 cambridge 02238 turkish march 1992
