2 |text from cheinan access digex com cheinan marks subject please recommend graphics library for mac organization express access online communications greenbelt usa lines 100 nntp posting host access digex net newsreader tin version pl8 robert carpenter writes netters building cad package and need graphics library that can handle some rudimentry tasks such hidden line removal shading animation etc can you please offer some recommendations also need contact info name address email you can find thanks please post your responses case others have same need bob carpenter the following extracted from sumex aim stanford edu should also the mirrors think there source for some applications that may have some bearing your project poke around the source directory never used this package nor know anyone who did but the price right hope this helps cheinan abstracts files thu apr pst 1993 directory info mac source binhex grafsys 121 hqx date fri mar 0100 from christian steffen ove franz cfranz iiic ethz questions mac archive umich edu subject grafsys incoming directory grafsys short description follows programmers grafsys vers now available version mainly bugfix for think users this version now runs with think promise the docs now contain chapter for programmers how use the grafsys you have problems feel free contact the other change that removed the fastperftrig calls from the fpu version make run faster those you who don know what all this about read programmers grafsys what didn you always have this great game mind where you needed some way drawing three dimensional scenes didn you always want write this program that visualized the structure three dimensional molecules and didn the task writing your conversions routines keep you from actually doing well the answer any the above questions yes but what has with this package read grafsys think pascal library that provides you with simple routines for building saving loading resources and manipulating independent rotating around arbitrary achses translating and scaling three dimensional objects objects not just simple single line drawings grafsys supports full clipping animation and some primitive hidden line hidden surface drawing with simple commands from within your program grafsys also supports full eye control with both perspective and parallel projections you can understand word don worry this just showing off for those who know about the docs that come with will try explain what all means later grafsys provides powerful interface supply your own drawing routines with data you can use grafsys the transformations and your own routines the actual drawing note that grafsys also provides drawing routines you don have worry about that you don want grafsys comes two versions one for the 881 and 020 above processors the other version uses fixed point arithmetic and runs any mac both versions are 100 source compatibel grafsys comes with extensive manual that teaches you the fundamentals graphics and how use the package demand big enough will convert the grafsys object class library however feelt that the way implemented now makes easier use for lot more people than the select oop guild grafsys free for any non commercial usage read the documentation enclosed enjoy christian franz
